ICd0P35F2wlbKAn-X5v1VT0Yn8w&oe=6AFB41E9"}, {"file_name": "A005.png", "id": "819581153033551", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75388619_819581156366884_3303305444869392341_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1FkssAVT0kYQ7kNvwFdK6c_&_nc_oc=AdqrEu1-ONH9QaqoqKhFFRxeV3NCw-EfEU8rMVAAlorQep4jkbOv5yavtp-3MWJuQZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSm8l8u35DIQWk7BLqXuP-sMVZnMuM2OiXX4h9yQT8c3g&oe=6AFB2E53"}, {"file_name": "A010.png", "id": "827378479253446", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031642_827378482586779_7895670322915773702_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cBbk1IZ3eV8Q7kNvwFbovsD&_nc_oc=Adqwd3DMiSCpo8vLRB2vbUAN1heBorrbKDhKRfMgmymdxSrMxAZyl9qw3miBw8ECcGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRD-tKtSrn_y0ByMgD4tO6Z6U0AmbTukkfwoQnQ9ZJKA&oe=6AFB4017"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "418487571043078", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982705_418487574376411_1497134519680794501_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3H8apen3iukQ7kNvwHsR2Ut&_nc_oc=Adr_tzoHPvstpWqD55svnIGqtUVlw9hlLOHleGpTrYH3g4ch_RPAPelop_4yGCckJXY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8KwZub1amsN11ndHHvtFegG7hQShecXBkjYn_nT3RCg&oe=6AFB2C7B"}, "display_name": "FloatingWorld", "keywords": ["FloatingWorld", "Raft", "Sandbox", "Survival", "Building"], "long_description": "\"Floating World\" is an ocean-themed survival building game where you must find food and resources to build a shelter and survive each day. your creativity and effort will guide you through this ocean world.\n\nThe game features numerous islands, a storyline, and puzzle elements, along with a wealth of building materials and tools. You can experiment with different architectural styles and use various tools to uncover the story of this floating world. \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\ud83d\udd0d\ud83d\udca1\n\nGameplay Description:\n\ud83c\udfe0\ud83e\ude91 Building System: Expand your activity area on the sea with a building gun. Construct houses, roofs, and eaves to create a comfortable home. \n\n\ud83d\udee5\ufe0f\u2699\ufe0f Navigation System: Build sails for your raft. For faster travel, construct engines and rudders to better control your journey.\n\n\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udd29 Synthesizer: Almost everything in the floating world can be crafted with this machine. Resources can also be recycled using it.\n\n\ud83c\udf92\ud83c\udfae Backpack System: Designed for VR, the backpack system allows you to store items just like in real life. \n\n\ud83c\udf31\ud83d\udc16 Survival Farming System: Besides basic ocean activities like fishing and grilling fish, you can also build planting pots to grow your own plants and even raise pigs on your raft.\n\n\ud83d\udd28\ud83d\udd2e Item Upgrade System: In the later stages, build an upgrader, mining machine, and teleporter to enhance your ship and make exploring the world easier.\n\n\ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfa8 Different Game Modes: The game offers Easy, Normal, Hard, Peaceful, and Creative modes. \n\ndiscord:\nhttps://discord.com/invite/KTjpGAFuGE", "short_description": "VR raft survival and building on the open sea. Gather food and materials, craft gear, and build bigger\u2014from a tiny raft to a full floating base\u2014then sail out to explore.\ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udc1f\ud83c\udf34"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://miyagamesvr.mystrikingly.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MiYa Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://miyagamesvr.mystrikingly.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104